# Averin

A professional GitHub repository intelligence CLI.

Averin analyzes public GitHub repositories and produces a structured
health report based on repository activity, maintenance, community
signals, documentation, and project metadata.

## Features

- GitHub repository analysis
- Repository health score
- Activity analysis
- Maintenance analysis
- Community analysis
- Documentation analysis
- Actionable recommendations
- JSON output
- Markdown reports
- GitHub token support
- TypeScript architecture
- CLI-first workflow

